    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Fat and Funny",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106618479454385453841/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoV9hrX6TydGSdAWrmyGV8NZoGaLAFGYwoqr8vL2v_FuJo0CRb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Gotta love the SAQ depot. What’s great is that you will find a lot here. And the more you buy the more you save. The downside, the selections are sometimes limited. As a gin drinker I find the 4-5 options limited. And what’s there changes often. But it’s clean, easy to navigate and the staff is helpful. *as a gay woman I have had zero issues here.",
        "time": 1608079464,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jason Fung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101220245964096501202/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUjdkT8LH39yvpEYLRtT4uRYxqImjRQgKALpRYNUlt6FZ5IYoWMAg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Not bad if you're looking for wine.\n\nThere's an irony to the SAQ Depot.  It's warehouse style, so there is a TON of wine, but the selection is oddly low (since it is pallettes of the same wine).\n\nWe walked through, but the wine prices seemed only okay.  If you're looking for quality and quantity of wine, then I recommend you go to the Costco next door.",
        "time": 1658265244,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tristan LabRat (Mr.LabRat)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111870811971025612177/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWVCnbEbP0f1xgTkdweOxrgO-fMWEmNxvi0oG3fDZVURSCp4CuiXQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "The selection at this location is quite limited compared to others, especially when it comes to the larger sized bottles like 1.75L for many of the types of spirits.",
        "time": 1706912518,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Icamps",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114619103787102712610/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7oRHeAFMyeSlovPewuu72IPNBJ6NHdnZDvDv2pTCHLDGvcQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Not the best selection.  Very limited for scotch and they never have Puy Fromage red.  Also the discount for 12 bottles is only 10% (reduced from 15%).  They post the price with discount included so make sure you read the fine print if you th 12 bottles",
        "time": 1749238764,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Thomas Januszewski",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100538199576158977016/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKz9L9qW271l5UIkMpVPAYRdpn3Q9EDh5sirAItZEsy4ISYBw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "12 bottle discount dropped from 15% to 10% last year. But still well worth it for mass consumers and collectors alike. Could have a better whiskey selection, but that's just splitting hairs.",
        "time": 1739824006,
